{"id":"W65482a082bc2fbbe092aa56c","zh":"移动车辆激励法","en":"","name":"移动车辆激励法","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W65482a082bc2fbbe092aa56c","text":"移动车辆激励法","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sb08912c7b974b3ee1513","source_id":"P112","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"采用移动车辆激励法时,往往存在计算长度上的限制, 特别是采用有限元建模时,其自由度较多,将占用较大的计算机内存并降低计算效率。","citations":[{"source_id":"P112","page":3,"page_end":3}]},{"id":"S2f465fdf452b8d4fecdd","source_id":"P112","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"由于线路参数在时间-空间域具有随机特性,在车辆-轨道耦合动力计算时,定点激励法 [3]不能反映线路参数随机时车轨系统振动响应的时变特征,须采用移动车辆激励法考虑车辆与轨道之间的相对运动状态。","citations":[{"source_id":"P112","page":3,"page_end":3}]}],"sources":{"P112":{"id":"P112","title":"用于铁路线路基础结构伤损识别的概率密度分布演化方法","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明,陈宪麦,陶伟峰","year":"2018","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2018.12.014","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-probability-density-distribution-evolution-method-for-damage-detection-of-railway-infrastructure"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"随车辆位置变化引入相应轨段参数，反映线路参数的空间随机性。","language":"zh","source_id":"P112","paper_slug":"2018-probability-density-distribution-evolution-method-for-damage-detection-of-railway-infrastructure","title":"用于铁路线路基础结构伤损识别的概率密度分布演化方法","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W351fa032004dc6375afe807a","name":"Moving vehicle excitation method","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W351fa032004dc6375afe807a","name":"Moving vehicle excitation method","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W351fa03